<title>AUSTRALIA: Rebel Sport year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Rebel Sport year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year ended March 31</p>
<p>			 (in A$ million unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 3.91 vs 3.09</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		  4.0 vs 4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Rebel Sport Ltd is a sporting goods retailer which is 20 percent owned by the Goh brothers of Singapore. The company also announced a one-for-10 bonus issue.</p>
</text>
